  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_61140b94-d003-4545-af95-b1351df2d6ee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"819\" height=\"187\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>伤害显示模组</strong>通过在被攻击实体上方直接显示伤害数值，增强你的Minecraft战斗体验。本模组提供清晰实时的伤害可视化效果，让战斗更具沉浸感且易于追踪。特别适合追求动态战斗体验的玩家！</p>\n<p>──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103569/description_9ab73378-0e53-4863-b8ce-e3dacb1b264b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"468\"></p>\n<p>──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103569/description_eda72572-db18-4bb7-8d95-2eced370819c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"468\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
